# Context

Per-domain working knowledge for Claude Code sessions

- [Agent](agent.md): Tool registry, system prompt, provider switch, and deploy-vs-local posture
- [Canvas](canvas.md): React Flow surface, reducer, view layouts, and tool-call-to-dispatch bridge
- [CI](ci.md): GitHub Actions workflow triggers, the verify jobs, and the bot-PR fixture refresh
- [Deploy](deploy.md): Cloud Run backend, Vercel frontend, Cloudflare domain, and the platform gotchas behind them
- [Development](development.md): Local dev workflow, scripts, WSL2 constraints, and the regen-gate pattern
- [Evals](evals.md): Retrieval ablation harness and agent-eval fixtures, two separate stacks
- [Python](python.md): FastAPI backend, Python tools, and Typer CLI structure
- [Retrieval](retrieval.md): Chunking, embedding prefix contract, and the RRF score floor
- [Web](web.md): Next.js app structure, layers, and conventions
